<title>HUNGARY: Meinl H1 op profit up, after-tax down.</title>
<headline>Meinl H1 op profit up, after-tax down.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-June 1997  Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 583.5    vs     398.9</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   392.5    vs     430.7</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	 392.5    vs     430.7</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     25,301.0    vs  19,662.0</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	    202.4    vs     118.8</p>
<p>    Material expenditure	21,875.1    vs  16,640.5</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditure	1,693.4    vs   1,560.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation		     353.1    vs     234.8</p>
<p>    Other costs			882.6    vs     712.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	     215.3    vs     308.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   193.4 loss vs    34.8 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    988.1    vs     294.6</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    1,181.5    vs     259.8</p>
<p>    Net extroardinary income	 2.4 profit vs   3.0 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue	 43.3    vs	 6.0</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.	 40.9    vs	 9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Csemege-Julius Meinl is a food retailer chain, majority-owned by Austria'a Meinl group.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
